[I] Auxiliary macros and functions for the C standard library

[T] c-stdaux contains support macros and auxiliary functions around the
[T] functionality of common C standard libraries, covering ISO C, POSIX and
[T] extended features of compilers like gcc and clang, such as cleanup
[T] attributes and assertion helpers. It is the base of the c-util libraries
[T] used by dbus-broker.

[U] https://github.com/c-util/c-stdaux

[A] C-stdaux Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

